.TH batten-artifacts 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-artifacts \- Write the committed derivations of the command surface
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten artifacts\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write the committed derivations of the command surface
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-artifacts\-write(1)
Write completions, man pages, schemas or the CLI reference where the caller names
.TP
batten\-artifacts\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
